@startuml 系统模块包图
' 胡豪 · 第二阶段分析 · 概念层包图
' 系统按部署单元分三层；模块主责见 design/design.txt 第 3 节
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F5F8FB
  BorderColor #6F97B8
  FontColor #1F2A37
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #6F97B8
}

package "客户端 client/（Flutter）" as Client {
  [features 页面模块\nmap / capture / dex / bag / profile] as Feat
  [core/api\n唯一网络层] as Api
  [core/location\n定位抽象] as Loc
}

package "服务端 server/（Spring Boot）" as Server {
  [capture 答题捕获\n主责：孙虹毅] as Capture
  [user 账号会话\n主责：闫昕（待建）] as User
  [study 自习驻留\n主责：董欣毓/赵冠钧（待建）] as Study
  [common 公共模块\n主责：胡豪] as Common
  [demo 旧攻城狮演示\n已有，冻结不扩展] as Demo
}

package "数据层（主责：胡豪）" as Data {
  database "嵌入式数据库\n（H2）" as DB
  [迁移脚本\ndb/migration] as Mig
}

Feat --> Api : 只经网络层
Api --> Capture : HTTP/JSON /api/v1
Api --> User : HTTP/JSON /api/v1
Api --> Study : HTTP/JSON /api/v1
Loc --> Feat : 位置样本

Capture --> Common : 公共类型 / Clock / 异常
User --> Common : 公共类型 / 时钟
Study --> Common : 公共类型 / 时钟

Capture ..> DB : 经 Repository 接口装配
User ..> DB : 经 Repository 接口装配
Study ..> DB : 经 Repository 接口装配
Mig --> DB : 版本化建表（只增不改）

note right of Demo
  demo 与正式模块互不依赖，
  仅共用应用入口；
  内存状态不参与数据关系设计
end note

note bottom of Client
  客户端不直连数据库；
  业务模块之间不互读数据表，
  必须走对方 service / 端口
end note
@enduml
